{
  "Parts & Components": "部件与结构",
  "Vernier Types": "游标卡尺类型",
  "Least Count": "最小分度值",
  "Zero Error": "零误差",
  "Reading Method": "读数方法",
  "Standard Vernier": "普通游标卡尺",
  "0–100 mm range": "量程 0–100 mm",
  "<h3>Standard Vernier Caliper</h3><p>The most common type used in workshops and laboratories. Features <strong>outside jaws</strong> for external measurements, <strong>inside jaws</strong> for bores and slots, and a <strong>depth rod</strong> for step heights.</p><ul><li>Range: 0–150 mm (typical) or 0–300 mm</li><li>Least count: 0.02 mm (50 divisions) or 0.05 mm (20 divisions)</li><li>Made of hardened stainless steel</li><li>Used in general-purpose dimensional inspection</li></ul>": "<h3>普通游标卡尺</h3><p>车间和实验室里最常见的一种。带<strong>外测量爪</strong>测外形尺寸、<strong>内测量爪</strong>测孔径和槽宽，还有<strong>测深杆</strong>测台阶高度。</p><ul><li>量程：常见 0–150 mm，也有 0–300 mm</li><li>最小分度值：0.02 mm（50 分度）或 0.05 mm（20 分度）</li><li>淬火不锈钢制造</li><li>用于一般精度的尺寸检验</li></ul>",
  "Dial Vernier": "带表卡尺",
  "Dial gauge readout": "表盘读数",
  "<h3>Dial Vernier Caliper</h3><p>Replaces the vernier scale with a <strong>dial indicator</strong> for easier reading. The dial displays the fractional millimetre directly, eliminating the need to find coincident lines.</p><ul><li>Resolution: 0.02 mm or 0.05 mm</li><li>Faster reading — reduces human error</li><li>More fragile due to internal gear mechanism</li><li>Popular in production inspection</li></ul>": "<h3>带表卡尺</h3><p>把游标刻度换成<strong>百分表</strong>，读数更轻松。表盘直接显示毫米小数部分，不必再去找对齐线。</p><ul><li>分辨力：0.02 mm 或 0.05 mm</li><li>读数更快 — 减少人为误差</li><li>内部有齿轮机构，相对娇气</li><li>常用于批量生产检验</li></ul>",
  "Digital Vernier": "数显卡尺",
  "LCD display": "液晶显示",
  "<h3>Digital Vernier Caliper</h3><p>Uses an electronic <strong>linear encoder</strong> and <strong>LCD display</strong> to show the measurement directly. Supports mm/inch switching and zero-set at any position.</p><ul><li>Resolution: 0.01 mm (higher than mechanical)</li><li>Features: mm/inch toggle, zero reset, data output port</li><li>Battery-powered (CR2032)</li><li>Most convenient but requires careful handling</li></ul>": "<h3>数显卡尺</h3><p>用电子<strong>容栅传感器</strong>加<strong>液晶屏</strong>直接显示测量值，支持毫米/英寸切换，也能在任意位置清零。</p><ul><li>分辨力：0.01 mm（高于机械式）</li><li>功能：毫米/英寸切换、清零、数据输出口</li><li>纽扣电池供电（CR2032）</li><li>最方便，但要小心使用</li></ul>",
  "Depth Vernier": "深度游标卡尺",
  "Depth measurement": "深度测量",
  "<h3>Depth Vernier Caliper</h3><p>Specialised caliper designed primarily for measuring <strong>depths of holes, slots, and steps</strong>. The base sits flat on the reference surface while the rod extends into the cavity.</p><ul><li>Range: 0–150 mm or 0–200 mm</li><li>Base width: 100 mm (provides stable reference)</li><li>Interchangeable rods for different depth ranges</li><li>Critical in machining stepped features</li></ul>": "<h3>深度游标卡尺</h3><p>专门用来测<strong>孔深、槽深和台阶高度</strong>的卡尺。底座平贴在基准面上，测杆伸入孔内。</p><ul><li>量程：0–150 mm 或 0–200 mm</li><li>底座宽度：100 mm（基准更稳）</li><li>可换测杆，覆盖不同深度范围</li><li>加工台阶类特征时必用</li></ul>",
  "0.02 mm LC": "0.02 mm 最小分度",
  "50-division scale": "50 分度游标",
  "<h3>0.02 mm Least Count (50 Divisions)</h3><p>The most precise mechanical vernier caliper. The vernier scale has <strong>50 divisions</strong> spanning 49 mm on the main scale.</p><div class=\"formula-box\">LC = 1 MSD − 1 VSD = 1 mm − 49/50 mm = 1/50 mm = <strong>0.02 mm</strong></div><p><strong>Example:</strong> MSR = 25 mm, VSR = 17th division coincides.<br>TR = 25 + (17 × 0.02) = 25 + 0.34 = <strong>25.34 mm</strong></p>": "<h3>0.02 mm 最小分度（50 分度）</h3><p>机械式游标卡尺中精度最高的一种。游标上有 <strong>50 个分度</strong>，总长对应主尺上的 49 mm。</p><div class=\"formula-box\">LC = 1 MSD − 1 VSD = 1 mm − 49/50 mm = 1/50 mm = <strong>0.02 mm</strong></div><p><strong>举例：</strong>MSR = 25 mm，游标第 17 格与主尺对齐。<br>TR = 25 + (17 × 0.02) = 25 + 0.34 = <strong>25.34 mm</strong></p>",
  "0.05 mm LC": "0.05 mm 最小分度",
  "20-division scale": "20 分度游标",
  "<h3>0.05 mm Least Count (20 Divisions)</h3><p>A common precision level where 20 vernier divisions span 19 mm on the main scale.</p><div class=\"formula-box\">LC = 1 MSD − 1 VSD = 1 mm − 19/20 mm = 1/20 mm = <strong>0.05 mm</strong></div><p><strong>Example:</strong> MSR = 32 mm, VSR = 9th division coincides.<br>TR = 32 + (9 × 0.05) = 32 + 0.45 = <strong>32.45 mm</strong></p>": "<h3>0.05 mm 最小分度（20 分度）</h3><p>很常见的一档精度，20 个游标分度对应主尺上的 19 mm。</p><div class=\"formula-box\">LC = 1 MSD − 1 VSD = 1 mm − 19/20 mm = 1/20 mm = <strong>0.05 mm</strong></div><p><strong>举例：</strong>MSR = 32 mm，游标第 9 格与主尺对齐。<br>TR = 32 + (9 × 0.05) = 32 + 0.45 = <strong>32.45 mm</strong></p>",
  "0.1 mm LC": "0.1 mm 最小分度",
  "10-division scale": "10 分度游标",
  "<h3>0.1 mm Least Count (10 Divisions)</h3><p>The simplest vernier scale where 10 divisions span 9 mm on the main scale.</p><div class=\"formula-box\">LC = 1 MSD − 1 VSD = 1 mm − 9/10 mm = 1/10 mm = <strong>0.1 mm</strong></div><p><strong>Example:</strong> MSR = 18 mm, VSR = 7th division coincides.<br>TR = 18 + (7 × 0.1) = 18 + 0.7 = <strong>18.7 mm</strong></p>": "<h3>0.1 mm 最小分度（10 分度）</h3><p>最简单的游标：10 个分度对应主尺上的 9 mm。</p><div class=\"formula-box\">LC = 1 MSD − 1 VSD = 1 mm − 9/10 mm = 1/10 mm = <strong>0.1 mm</strong></div><p><strong>举例：</strong>MSR = 18 mm，游标第 7 格与主尺对齐。<br>TR = 18 + (7 × 0.1) = 18 + 0.7 = <strong>18.7 mm</strong></p>",
  "0.001″ LC": "0.001″ 最小分度",
  "Imperial 25-division": "英制 25 分度",
  "<h3>0.001″ Least Count (Imperial, 25 Divisions)</h3><p>The standard imperial vernier caliper. The main scale is divided into <strong>40ths of an inch</strong> (0.025″ per division). The vernier has <strong>25 divisions</strong> spanning 24 main divisions.</p><div class=\"formula-box\">LC = 1 MSD − 1 VSD = 0.025″ − 24/25 × 0.025″ = 0.025″/25 = <strong>0.001″</strong></div><p><strong>Example:</strong> MSR = 1.350″, VSR = 14th division coincides.<br>TR = 1.350 + (14 × 0.001) = <strong>1.364″</strong></p>": "<h3>0.001″ 最小分度（英制，25 分度）</h3><p>标准英制游标卡尺。主尺按<strong>四十分之一英寸</strong>分度（每格 0.025″），游标有 <strong>25 个分度</strong>，对应主尺 24 格。</p><div class=\"formula-box\">LC = 1 MSD − 1 VSD = 0.025″ − 24/25 × 0.025″ = 0.025″/25 = <strong>0.001″</strong></div><p><strong>举例：</strong>MSR = 1.350″，游标第 14 格与主尺对齐。<br>TR = 1.350 + (14 × 0.001) = <strong>1.364″</strong></p>",
  "1/128″ LC": "1/128″ 最小分度",
  "Fractional 8-division": "分数英制 8 分度",
  "<h3>1/128″ Least Count (Fractional, 8 Divisions)</h3><p>The fractional-inch caliper, still standard in fitting, sheet-metal and fabrication work where drawings are dimensioned in halves, quarters, eighths and sixteenths. The beam is divided into <strong>sixteenths of an inch</strong>, and the vernier has <strong>8 divisions</strong> spanning 7 main divisions (7/16″).</p><div class='formula-box'>LC = 1 MSD − 1 VSD = 1/16″ − 7/8 × 1/16″ = 1/16″ ÷ 8 = <strong>1/128″</strong></div><p><strong>Example:</strong> MSR = 1 5/16″, VSR = 3rd division coincides.<br>TR = 1 5/16 + 3/128 = 1 40/128 + 3/128 = <strong>1 43/128″</strong></p><p>Read it as a fraction, never as a decimal — that is the whole point of the scale.</p>": "<h3>1/128″ 最小分度（分数英制，8 分度）</h3><p>分数英寸卡尺，在装配、钣金和制作行业里仍是标准配置 — 那些图纸用 1/2、1/4、1/8、1/16 标注尺寸。尺身按<strong>十六分之一英寸</strong>分度，游标有 <strong>8 个分度</strong>，对应主尺 7 格（7/16″）。</p><div class='formula-box'>LC = 1 MSD − 1 VSD = 1/16″ − 7/8 × 1/16″ = 1/16″ ÷ 8 = <strong>1/128″</strong></div><p><strong>举例：</strong>MSR = 1 5/16″，游标第 3 格与主尺对齐。<br>TR = 1 5/16 + 3/128 = 1 40/128 + 3/128 = <strong>1 43/128″</strong></p><p>读数要用分数，不要写成小数 — 这正是这种刻度存在的意义。</p>",
  "No Zero Error": "无零误差",
  "Zeros align perfectly": "两个零位完全对齐",
  "<h3>No Zero Error</h3><p>When the jaws are fully closed, the <strong>zero mark of the vernier scale aligns exactly</strong> with the zero mark of the main scale. This is the ideal condition.</p><ul><li>Close the jaws gently with no object</li><li>Check: vernier 0 should align with main scale 0</li><li>Also check: the last vernier division should align with a main scale mark</li></ul>": "<h3>无零误差</h3><p>两爪完全闭合时，游标的<strong>零刻度线与主尺零刻度线精确重合</strong>，这是理想状态。</p><ul><li>不夹工件，轻轻闭合量爪</li><li>检查：游标 0 应与主尺 0 对齐</li><li>再检查：游标最后一格也应与主尺某条线对齐</li></ul>",
  "Positive Error": "正零误差",
  "Vernier zero to the right": "游标零线偏右",
  "<h3>Positive Zero Error</h3><p>When jaws are closed, the vernier zero is <strong>to the right</strong> of the main scale zero. The caliper reads <em>more</em> than the actual dimension.</p><div class=\"formula-box\">Corrected Reading = Observed Reading − Zero Error</div><p><strong>Example:</strong> 3rd division coincides, LC = 0.02 mm.<br>Zero Error = +0.06 mm. If observed = 25.40 mm, corrected = <strong>25.34 mm</strong>.</p>": "<h3>正零误差</h3><p>两爪闭合时，游标零线在主尺零线的<strong>右侧</strong>，读数比实际尺寸<em>偏大</em>。</p><div class=\"formula-box\">修正后读数 = 观测读数 − 零误差</div><p><strong>举例：</strong>第 3 格对齐，LC = 0.02 mm。<br>零误差 = +0.06 mm。若观测读数 25.40 mm，则修正后 <strong>25.34 mm</strong>。</p>",
  "Negative Error": "负零误差",
  "Vernier zero to the left": "游标零线偏左",
  "<h3>Negative Zero Error</h3><p>When jaws are closed, the vernier zero is <strong>to the left</strong> of the main scale zero. The caliper reads <em>less</em> than the actual dimension.</p><div class=\"formula-box\">Corrected Reading = Observed Reading + |Zero Error|</div><p><strong>Example:</strong> 47th division coincides (50-div scale), LC = 0.02 mm.<br>Zero Error = −(50 − 47) × 0.02 = −0.06 mm. If observed = 25.28 mm, corrected = <strong>25.34 mm</strong>.</p>": "<h3>负零误差</h3><p>两爪闭合时，游标零线在主尺零线的<strong>左侧</strong>，读数比实际尺寸<em>偏小</em>。</p><div class=\"formula-box\">修正后读数 = 观测读数 + |零误差|</div><p><strong>举例：</strong>第 47 格对齐（50 分度游标），LC = 0.02 mm。<br>零误差 = −(50 − 47) × 0.02 = −0.06 mm。若观测读数 25.28 mm，则修正后 <strong>25.34 mm</strong>。</p>",
  "Zero Correction": "零误差修正",
  "How to correct": "如何修正",
  "<h3>Zero Error Correction</h3><ol><li>Close jaws gently without any object.</li><li>Check if vernier zero aligns with main scale zero.</li><li>If not, note which vernier division coincides with a main scale line.</li><li>Calculate:<ul><li>Vernier zero to the <em>right</em>: ZE = +(coincident div × LC)</li><li>Vernier zero to the <em>left</em>: ZE = −(n − coincident div) × LC</li></ul></li><li>Corrected = Observed − Zero Error</li></ol>": "<h3>零误差修正</h3><ol><li>不夹工件，轻轻闭合量爪。</li><li>检查游标零线是否与主尺零线对齐。</li><li>若没对齐，记下与主尺线对齐的是游标第几格。</li><li>计算：<ul><li>游标零线偏<em>右</em>：ZE = +（对齐格数 × LC）</li><li>游标零线偏<em>左</em>：ZE = −（n − 对齐格数）× LC</li></ul></li><li>修正后读数 = 观测读数 − 零误差</li></ol>",
  "Step 1: MSR": "第 1 步：MSR",
  "Main Scale Reading": "主尺读数",
  "<h3>Step 1 — Main Scale Reading (MSR)</h3><p>Look at the <strong>zero line</strong> of the vernier scale. Read the main scale graduation <strong>immediately to the left</strong> of this zero line. This gives the whole-millimetre (SI) or 0.025″ (imperial) reading.</p><p><strong>SI:</strong> MSR is in whole mm.<br><strong>Imperial:</strong> MSR is in multiples of 0.025″.</p>": "<h3>第 1 步 — 主尺读数（MSR）</h3><p>先看游标爪上的<strong>零线</strong>，读出它<strong>左侧最近</strong>的那条主尺刻度线，那就是整毫米（公制）或 0.025″（英制）部分。</p><p><strong>公制：</strong>MSR 取整数毫米。<br><strong>英制：</strong>MSR 取 0.025″ 的整数倍。</p>",
  "Step 2: VSR": "第 2 步：VSR",
  "Vernier Scale Reading": "游标读数",
  "<h3>Step 2 — Vernier Scale Reading (VSR)</h3><p>Find the <strong>one division</strong> on the vernier scale that aligns perfectly with <em>any</em> main scale graduation. The golden-highlighted tick in this simulator shows it.</p>": "<h3>第 2 步 — 游标读数（VSR）</h3><p>在游标上找出<strong>唯一一格</strong>与主尺<em>任意</em>刻度线完全对齐的刻线。模拟器里用金色高亮标出的就是它。</p>",
  "<p><strong>Read the numerals carefully.</strong> A metric vernier is numbered in <strong>tenths of a millimetre</strong> — 0 1 2 … 9 0 — and the last numeral closes back on <strong>0</strong> because the whole vernier spans exactly 1 mm. Those numerals are <em>counting aids</em>, not the VSR.</p>": "<p><strong>注意游标上的数字。</strong>公制游标的 0.02&nbsp;mm 与 0.1&nbsp;mm 两档按<strong>十分之一毫米</strong>刻数字 — 0 1 2 … 9 0，最后一个数字又回到 <strong>0</strong>，因为整个游标正好跨过 1 mm。这些数字只是<em>数格子时的辅助</em>，并不是 VSR。</p><p><strong>0.05&nbsp;mm（20 分度）这一档例外</strong>：它按格数标注 <strong>0&nbsp;5&nbsp;10&nbsp;15&nbsp;20</strong>，每个数字本身就是格号，所以数格子可以直接数着数字走 — 第 13 格就是数字 10 之后再过 3 格。</p>",
  "<div class=\"formula-box\">VSR = the number of DIVISIONS from the vernier zero</div>": "<div class=\"formula-box\">VSR = 从游标零线起数出的分度格数</div>",
  "<p>So on a 0.02 mm scale, a line three divisions past the numeral <strong>4</strong> is division <strong>23</strong> (4 × 5 + 3), giving 23 × 0.02 = 0.46 mm. Count divisions, never numerals.</p>": "<p>所以在 0.02 mm 的游标上，数字 <strong>4</strong> 之后再数三格，是第 <strong>23</strong> 格（4 × 5 + 3），对应 23 × 0.02 = 0.46 mm。要数格子，不要数数字。</p>",
  "<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use the Zoom feature to magnify the scale. In a 50-division vernier, adjacent ticks are very close.</p>": "<p><strong>提示：</strong>用「放大」功能放大刻度。50 分度游标的相邻刻线挨得非常近。</p>",
  "Step 3: Calculate": "第 3 步：计算",
  "TR = MSR + VSR × LC": "TR = MSR + VSR × LC",
  "<h3>Step 3 — Calculate Total Reading</h3><div class=\"formula-box\">TR = MSR + (VSR × LC)</div><p><strong>SI Example (0.02 mm LC):</strong><br>MSR = 25 mm, VSR = 17 → TR = 25 + 0.34 = <strong>25.34 mm</strong></p><p><strong>Imperial Example (0.001″ LC):</strong><br>MSR = 1.350″, VSR = 14 → TR = 1.350 + 0.014 = <strong>1.364″</strong></p>": "<h3>第 3 步 — 计算总读数</h3><div class=\"formula-box\">TR = MSR + (VSR × LC)</div><p><strong>公制举例（LC = 0.02 mm）：</strong><br>MSR = 25 mm，VSR = 17 → TR = 25 + 0.34 = <strong>25.34 mm</strong></p><p><strong>英制举例（LC = 0.001″）：</strong><br>MSR = 1.350″，VSR = 14 → TR = 1.350 + 0.014 = <strong>1.364″</strong></p>",
  "Common Errors": "常见错误",
  "Mistakes to avoid": "要避免的失误",
  "<h3>Common Reading Errors</h3><ul><li><strong>Parallax error:</strong> Reading at an angle instead of straight down.</li><li><strong>Wrong MSR:</strong> Reading the mark to the <em>right</em> of vernier zero instead of left.</li><li><strong>Forcing alignment:</strong> Squeezing jaws too hard, deforming soft materials.</li><li><strong>Ignoring zero error:</strong> Not checking zero alignment before measuring.</li><li><strong>Estimating between divisions:</strong> Never interpolate — the reading is determined only by the coincident line.</li></ul>": "<h3>常见读数错误</h3><ul><li><strong>视差：</strong>斜着看刻度，而不是垂直俯视。</li><li><strong>MSR 取错：</strong>看了游标零线<em>右侧</em>那条线，而不是左侧。</li><li><strong>用力过猛：</strong>把量爪夹得太紧，软材料被压变形。</li><li><strong>忽略零误差：</strong>测量前没检查零位是否对齐。</li><li><strong>在两格之间估读：</strong>不要插值 — 读数只由那条对齐线决定。</li></ul>",
  "Fixed Jaw (Main Frame)": "固定量爪（尺身）",
  "Reference body of the caliper": "整把卡尺的基准体",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Structure</span><h3>Fixed Jaw (Main Frame)</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">结构</span><h3>固定量爪（尺身）</h3>",
  "<p>The fixed jaw is forged in one piece with the <strong>main scale beam</strong>. It never moves, so its measuring face defines the <strong>zero reference</strong> for every reading you take.</p>": "<p>固定量爪与<strong>主尺尺身</strong>锻成一体，从不移动，所以它的测量面就是每次读数的<strong>零位基准</strong>。</p>",
  "<ul><li>Carries both the lower outside jaw and the upper inside jaw</li><li>Hardened and lapped measuring faces (58–62 HRC typical)</li><li>Because it is integral with the beam, a dropped caliper usually loses accuracy here first</li></ul>": "<ul><li>同时带有下方的外测量爪和上方的内测量爪</li><li>测量面淬火并研磨（一般 58–62 HRC）</li><li>因为它与尺身是一体的，卡尺摔落后往往首先在这里失准</li></ul>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>Workshop tip:</strong> Always seat the workpiece firmly against the <em>fixed</em> jaw and bring the sliding jaw up to it — never the other way round. This keeps the part square to the beam.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>车间经验：</strong>一定要把工件靠紧<em>固定</em>量爪，再推游标量爪去贴合 — 不要反过来。这样工件才对尺身保持垂直。</div>",
  "Sliding Jaw (Vernier Head)": "游标量爪（游标头）",
  "Carries the vernier scale": "承载游标刻度",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Structure</span><h3>Sliding Jaw (Vernier Head)</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">结构</span><h3>游标量爪（游标头）</h3>",
  "<p>The movable assembly that slides along the beam. It carries the <strong>vernier scale</strong>, the outside and inside jaws, the depth rod, the thumb roller and the locking screw — everything that moves, moves together.</p>": "<p>沿尺身滑动的可动组件，带着<strong>游标刻度</strong>、内外量爪、测深杆、拇指滚轮和紧固螺钉 — 所有会动的东西都一起动。</p>",
  "<ul><li>Slides in a precision-ground groove; a leaf spring inside keeps it from rocking</li><li>Its left face is exactly in line with the vernier zero line</li><li>Excess play here (jaw \"rock\") is the most common cause of scatter in readings</li></ul>": "<ul><li>在精磨导轨槽里滑动，内部有片弹簧防止晃动</li><li>它的左侧面与游标零线严格在同一平面内</li><li>这里间隙过大（量爪\"晃\"）是读数分散最常见的原因</li></ul>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>Check it:</strong> Hold the caliper up to a light with the jaws closed. If light passes between the faces, the head is worn or the jaws are sprung.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>检查方法：</strong>把量爪闭合后对着光源看，若两测量面之间透光，说明游标头磨损或量爪变形。</div>",
  "Outside (External) Jaws": "外测量爪",
  "Shafts, rods, thicknesses": "轴径、杆径、厚度",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Measuring</span><h3>Outside (External) Jaws</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">测量</span><h3>外测量爪</h3>",
  "<p>The large lower jaws. Their <strong>inner faces</strong> close onto the workpiece to measure external dimensions — shaft diameters, plate thickness, block widths.</p>": "<p>下方那对大量爪。用它们的<strong>内侧面</strong>夹住工件，测量外形尺寸 — 轴径、板厚、块宽。</p>",
  "<dl class=\"pi-spec\"><dt>Faces used</dt><dd>Inner (facing each other)</dd><dt>Reads</dt><dd>Directly on the scale</dd><dt>Typical use</dt><dd>Shaft Ø, thickness, width</dd></dl>": "<dl class=\"pi-spec\"><dt>使用面</dt><dd>内侧面（两爪相对）</dd><dt>读数</dt><dd>直接读刻度</dd><dt>典型用途</dt><dd>轴径、厚度、宽度</dd></dl>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>Watch out:</strong> Measure across the <em>full flat</em> of the jaw, close to the beam. Measuring on the jaw tips lets the jaws spring open and reads large.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>注意：</strong>要量在量爪<em>整块平面</em>上、靠近尺身的位置。量在爪尖上量爪会张开，读数偏大。</div>",
  "Inside (Internal) Jaws": "内测量爪",
  "Bores, slots, grooves": "孔径、槽宽、沟槽",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Measuring</span><h3>Inside (Internal) Jaws</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">测量</span><h3>内测量爪</h3>",
  "<p>The small knife-edged jaws above the beam. Their <strong>outer faces</strong> press outwards against a bore or slot, so the caliper reads internal dimensions.</p>": "<p>尺身上方那对小刀口量爪。它们的<strong>外侧面</strong>向外顶住孔壁或槽壁，因此能读出内尺寸。</p>",
  "<dl class=\"pi-spec\"><dt>Faces used</dt><dd>Outer (facing away)</dd><dt>Reads</dt><dd>Directly on modern calipers</dd><dt>Typical use</dt><dd>Hole Ø, slot width, groove</dd></dl>": "<dl class=\"pi-spec\"><dt>使用面</dt><dd>外侧面（两爪相背）</dd><dt>读数</dt><dd>现代卡尺直接读数</dd><dt>典型用途</dt><dd>孔径、槽宽、沟槽</dd></dl>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>Older calipers:</strong> On some designs the jaw thickness (often stamped on the blade, e.g. 10 mm) must be <em>added</em> to the scale reading. Modern nib-style jaws read directly — check your instrument before assuming.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>老式卡尺：</strong>有些设计必须把量爪厚度（常冲印在尺身上，如 10 mm）<em>加上</em>才是实际尺寸。现代的爪尖式量爪可直接读数 — 用前先确认你的量具属于哪种。</div>",
  "Main Scale (Beam)": "主尺（尺身）",
  "The fixed graduated blade": "固定刻度尺身",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Scale</span><h3>Main Scale (Beam)</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">刻度</span><h3>主尺（尺身）</h3>",
  "<p>The long, rigid steel blade that everything else rides on. It carries the <strong>metric graduations on one edge</strong> and the <strong>inch graduations on the other</strong>, and its stiffness is what holds the two jaws parallel.</p>": "<p>又长又硬的钢尺身，其他一切部件都在它上面滑动。它<strong>一边刻公制</strong>、<strong>另一边刻英制</strong>，靠自身刚性保证两量爪保持平行。</p>",
  "<ul><li>Common capacities: 0–150 mm, 0–200 mm, 0–300 mm</li><li>Hardened stainless steel, satin-chrome finished to kill glare</li><li>A groove machined along its underside houses the depth rod</li></ul>": "<ul><li>常见量程：0–150 mm、0–200 mm、0–300 mm</li><li>淬火不锈钢，镀哑光镀铬层以消除反光</li><li>下侧铣有一条导槽，用来装测深杆</li></ul>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>Remember:</strong> The beam is the <em>datum</em>. Any bend in it puts an error into every measurement, so never use a caliper as a scriber, pry bar or clamp.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>记住：</strong>尺身就是<em>基准</em>。它一旦弯曲，所有测量都会带误差，所以绝不要拿卡尺当划针、撬棍或卡钳用。</div>",
  "Metric Main Graduations": "公制主尺分度",
  "1 mm divisions (1 MSD)": "每格 1 mm（1 MSD）",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Scale</span><h3>Metric Main Scale Graduations</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">刻度</span><h3>公制主尺分度</h3>",
  "<p>The millimetre scale along the lower edge. One division = <strong>1 mm</strong>, and this is what the abbreviation <strong>1 MSD</strong> (Main Scale Division) means in every least-count formula.</p>": "<p>尺身下缘的毫米刻度。一格 = <strong>1 mm</strong>，各种最小分度值公式里的 <strong>1 MSD</strong>（主尺分度）指的就是它。</p>",
  "<div class=\"formula-box\">1 MSD = 1 mm &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; numbered every 10th line</div>": "<div class=\"formula-box\">1 MSD = 1 mm &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; 每 10 格标一个数字</div>",
  "<p>To read it, look at where the <strong>vernier zero line</strong> falls and take the <em>last main-scale line it has passed</em> — never the one ahead of it. In the diagram above the vernier zero sits on 36, so MSR = 36 mm.</p>": "<p>读数时看<strong>游标零线</strong>落在哪里，取它<em>已经越过的最后一条主尺线</em> — 绝不能取它前面那条。上图里游标零线落在 36 处，所以 MSR = 36 mm。</p>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>Exam favourite:</strong> Rounding the MSR up because the vernier zero is \"nearly\" at the next line loses the mark. The MSR is always rounded <em>down</em>; the fraction comes from the vernier.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>考试常考点：</strong>因为游标零线\"差不多\"到了下一条线就把 MSR 往上取整，是要扣分的。MSR 永远<em>向下</em>取整，小数部分交给游标。</div>",
  "Inch (Imperial) Scale": "英制刻度",
  "1/40\" = 0.025\" divisions": "每格 1/40\" = 0.025\"",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Scale</span><h3>Inch (Imperial) Main Scale</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">刻度</span><h3>英制主尺</h3>",
  "<p>The upper edge of the beam is divided into <strong>fortieths of an inch</strong>. Each small division is 0.025&Prime;, with every fourth line (0.100&Prime;) taller and each whole inch numbered. On the fractional caliper the same edge carries <strong>sixteenths</strong>, stepped 1&Prime; &gt; 1/2&Prime; &gt; 1/4&Prime; &gt; 1/8&Prime; &gt; 1/16&Prime; in tick height so sixteenths can be counted without reading a number.</p>": "<p>尺身上缘按<strong>四十分之一英寸</strong>分度。每小格 0.025&Prime;，每第 4 格（0.100&Prime;）刻线更长，每个整英寸标数字。分数英制卡尺的同一侧改成<strong>十六分之一英寸</strong>分度，刻线高度按 1&Prime; &gt; 1/2&Prime; &gt; 1/4&Prime; &gt; 1/8&Prime; &gt; 1/16&Prime; 递减，不看数字也能数出十六分之一。</p>",
  "<div class=\"formula-box\">1 MSD = 1/40&Prime; = <strong>0.025&Prime;</strong></div>": "<div class=\"formula-box\">1 MSD = 1/40&Prime; = <strong>0.025&Prime;</strong></div>",
  "<p>Paired with a 25-division vernier this gives the standard imperial least count of <strong>0.001&Prime;</strong>. Switch to the fractional caliper and the same beam is re-engraved in <strong>sixteenths</strong>, read against an 8-division vernier for <strong>1/128&Prime;</strong>. The inch and metric sides are two independent instruments sharing one beam — read one or the other, never a mixture.</p>": "<p>配上 25 分度的游标，就得到英制标准最小分度值 <strong>0.001&Prime;</strong>。切到分数英制卡尺，同一条尺身重刻为<strong>十六分之一英寸</strong>，配 8 分度游标，得到 <strong>1/128&Prime;</strong>。英制侧和公制侧是共用一条尺身的两个独立量具 — 只能读其中一套，绝不能混着读。</p>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>Conversion:</strong> 1&Prime; = 25.4 mm exactly. A 0.001&Prime; caliper resolves 0.0254 mm — slightly finer than a 0.02 mm metric vernier.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>换算：</strong>1&Prime; 精确等于 25.4 mm。0.001&Prime; 的卡尺可分辨 0.0254 mm — 比 0.02 mm 的公制游标还略细一点。</div>",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Scale</span><h3>Vernier Scale</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">刻度</span><h3>游标刻度</h3>",
  "<p>The short auxiliary scale engraved on the sliding head — metric below the beam, inch above it. Its divisions are deliberately made <em>slightly smaller</em> than the main-scale divisions, and that tiny difference is the instrument’s <strong>least count</strong>.</p>": "<p>刻在游标头上的短辅助刻度 — 公制在尺身下方，英制在上方。它的每一格都比主尺每格<em>略小一点</em>，这个微小差值就是这把量具的<strong>最小分度值</strong>。</p>",
  "<div class=\"formula-box\">LC = 1 MSD − 1 VSD = 1 MSD / n</div>": "<div class=\"formula-box\">LC = 1 MSD − 1 VSD = 1 MSD / n</div>",
  "<dl class=\"pi-spec\"><dt>10 divisions</dt><dd>LC = 0.1 mm</dd><dt>20 divisions</dt><dd>LC = 0.05 mm</dd><dt>50 divisions</dt><dd>LC = 0.02 mm</dd><dt>25 divisions (inch)</dt><dd>LC = 0.001&Prime;</dd><dt>8 divisions (fractional inch)</dt><dd>LC = 1/128&Prime;</dd></dl>": "<dl class=\"pi-spec\"><dt>10 分度</dt><dd>LC = 0.1 mm</dd><dt>20 分度</dt><dd>LC = 0.05 mm</dd><dt>50 分度</dt><dd>LC = 0.02 mm</dd><dt>25 分度（英制）</dt><dd>LC = 0.001&Prime;</dd><dt>8 分度（分数英制）</dt><dd>LC = 1/128&Prime;</dd></dl>",
  "<p>Only <strong>one</strong> vernier line can line up perfectly with a main-scale line. Its number, multiplied by the least count, is the fraction you add to the MSR.</p>": "<p>只能有<strong>一条</strong>游标线与主尺线完全对齐。它的格数乘以最小分度值，就是加到 MSR 上的小数部分。</p>",
  "Vernier Zero Line": "游标零线",
  "The pointer / index line": "指针/指示线",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Reading</span><h3>Vernier Zero Line (Index)</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">读数</span><h3>游标零线（指示线）</h3>",
  "<p>The single most important line on the instrument. It is machined <strong>exactly in line with the sliding jaw’s measuring face</strong>, so it acts as the pointer that reads the main scale.</p>": "<p>整把量具上最重要的一条线。它与<strong>游标量爪的测量面严格对齐</strong>，所以它扮演读取主尺的指针。</p>",
  "<ul><li>Its position gives the <strong>main scale reading (MSR)</strong></li><li>With the jaws closed it must sit on main-scale zero — if not, the caliper has a <strong>zero error</strong></li><li>Vernier division counting always starts from this line, counted as 0</li></ul>": "<ul><li>它的位置决定<strong>主尺读数（MSR）</strong></li><li>量爪闭合时它必须落在主尺零线上 — 否则这把卡尺有<strong>零误差</strong></li><li>数游标格数时永远从这条线起算，记为 0</li></ul>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>Zero check first, every time:</strong> Close the jaws gently and look at this line. Zero error found here is added to or subtracted from every reading in the batch.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>每次先查零位：</strong>轻轻闭合量爪，看这条线。这里发现的零误差会影响这一批测量的每一个读数。</div>",
  "Depth Measuring Rod": "测深杆",
  "Holes, slots, step heights": "孔深、槽深、台阶高",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Measuring</span><h3>Depth Measuring Rod (Depth Bar)</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">测量</span><h3>测深杆</h3>",
  "<p>A thin blade that runs in a groove under the beam and extends out of the far end as the head slides. Stand the <strong>end of the beam</strong> flat across the mouth of a hole and the rod drops to the bottom — the scale reads the depth directly.</p>": "<p>一根薄钢条，在尺身下侧的导槽里滑动，游标头一动就从尾端伸出来。把<strong>尺身尾端</strong>平放在孔口上，测深杆落到孔底 — 刻度直接读出深度。</p>",
  "<ul><li>Used for blind-hole depths, slot depths and counterbore depths</li><li>The beam end is the reference surface, so it must bridge the hole squarely</li><li>Slender and easily bent — never push the rod against the work</li></ul>": "<ul><li>用来测盲孔深、槽深和沉孔深</li><li>尺身尾端是基准面，必须垂直跨在孔口上</li><li>又细又容易弯 — 绝不要硬顶工件</li></ul>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>Accuracy note:</strong> A caliper depth rod is the least accurate feature on the tool. For anything tighter than about ±0.05 mm, use a proper depth micrometer or depth gauge.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>精度提醒：</strong>测深杆是这把量具里精度最低的部分。要求优于约 ±0.05 mm 时，请用深度千分尺或深度尺。</div>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>Try it:</strong> close this panel, choose <em>Measure an object</em> and pick the <strong>blind hole</strong>, <strong>counterbore</strong> or <strong>slot</strong>. The block is drawn in section so you can watch the rod go down.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>动手试试：</strong>关闭本面板，点<em>测量工件</em>，选<strong>盲孔</strong>、<strong>沉孔</strong>或<strong>铣削槽</strong>。量块以剖面方式绘制，能看到测深杆下沉的全过程。</div>",
  "Thumb Roller (Fine Adjustment)": "拇指滚轮（微调）",
  "Controls jaw pressure": "控制夹紧力",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Control</span><h3>Thumb Roller / Thumb Screw</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">操作件</span><h3>拇指滚轮 / 微调螺钉</h3>",
  "<p>The knurled wheel under the sliding head. Driving the head with your thumb here — instead of shoving the frame — gives you fine, <strong>repeatable contact pressure</strong> on the workpiece.</p>": "<p>游标头下方的滚花轮。用拇指拨它来推移游标头 — 而不是推整个尺框 — 才能得到细微且<strong>可重复的接触压力</strong>。</p>",
  "<ul><li>Close until the jaws just \"kiss\" the part and it can still be drawn out with light drag</li><li>Consistent feel matters more than force: it is what makes two readings agree</li><li>Over-tightening springs the jaws and compresses soft materials — both read wrong</li></ul>": "<ul><li>合拢到量爪刚\"贴上\"工件，工件仍能被轻轻抽出</li><li>手感一致比用力大小更重要：这才是两次读数能对上的原因</li><li>夹得过紧会让量爪张开、软材料被压缩 — 两种情况的读数都是错的</li></ul>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Jaw over-pressure is one of the largest error sources in caliper work, often several times the least count. The roller exists purely to control it.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>为什么重要：</strong>夹紧力过大是卡尺测量最大的误差来源之一，常常是最小分度值的好几倍。滚轮存在的唯一目的就是控制它。</div>",
  "Locking Screw": "紧固螺钉",
  "Freezes the reading": "锁定读数",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Control</span><h3>Locking Screw (Clamp Screw)</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">操作件</span><h3>紧固螺钉（锁紧螺钉）</h3>",
  "<p>A small thumbscrew on top of the sliding head that clamps it to the beam so the setting cannot drift while you read it or lift the caliper away from the work.</p>": "<p>游标头顶部的小螺钉，把游标头夹紧在尺身上，这样你读数或把卡尺从工件上拿开时，尺寸不会跑掉。</p>",
  "<ul><li>Lock <em>after</em> setting, then withdraw the caliper and read it in good light</li><li>Also used to hold a set size for transferring or scribing</li><li>Tighten gently — a hard nip can distort the head and shift the reading</li></ul>": "<ul><li>调好尺寸<em>之后</em>再锁紧，然后把卡尺拿开，在光线好的地方读数</li><li>也用来锁定尺寸，便于传递到其他量具或划线</li><li>轻轻拧紧即可 — 用力过猛会让游标头变形、读数偏移</li></ul>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>Habit to build:</strong> Lock → remove → read at eye level, straight down onto the scale. This kills both jaw-pressure drift and parallax error in one move.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>要养成的习惯：</strong>锁紧 → 取开 → 眼睛平视、垂直俯视刻度读数。一步同时消除夹紧力漂移和视差。</div>",
  "Labelled diagram of a vernier caliper showing its twelve main parts": "游标卡尺十二个主要部件的标注图",
  "Vernier Scale": "游标刻度",
  "The fractional (sliding) scale": "分数（滑动）刻度"
}